  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:36pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;During &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;six&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; months ended &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;, 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;, pursuant to the Cash Management Agreement among Buckeye &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Pipe Line&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; Transportation LLC and its affiliates, the Company effected a settlement of its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;receivable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; Buckeye Partners, L.P. in the amount of $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;, previously included in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Receivable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; Affiliated Companies, through a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;de&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;crease&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;of its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Additional Paid-in-Capital&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;, effectively representing a non-cash &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;dis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;tribution &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; Buckeye Partners, L.P.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
